#!/usr/bin/env toolang

# LLM wiki file request example.
#
# Run:
# mkdir -p wiki-inbox
# toolang examples/llm-wiki.too --inbox ./wiki-inbox
#
# Drop documents, images, audio, video, or other files into ./wiki-inbox.
# The `file` agic turns each file into a concise wiki page in:
#
# examples/.toolang/agents/llm-wiki/wiki/
agic file(in: Part[]):
  tools = filesystem/*

  user:
    Process the current file request immediately. Do not ask for confirmation.
    Maintain an LLM-readable wiki under `wiki/` in the agent home.

  Write one concise Markdown page under `wiki/pages/` for this file.
  Append one short link entry to `wiki/index.md`.

  Each page should contain only useful text: a title, source reference when
  visible, a compact summary, key facts, and searchable keywords.
  After writing, reply with only: Wikified `<file name or path>`.

agic chat(in: Part[]):
  tools = filesystem/*

  user:
    Answer from the wiki in the agent home. Read `wiki/index.md` first, then
    read the relevant pages under `wiki/pages/` before answering.
    If the wiki does not contain enough information, say what is missing.
